    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Superb 2 bedroom duplex apartment within a gated development in the heart of Malahide. \r\n\r\nA charming duplex residence situated in a small prestigious residential development just off Old Street in the centre of Malahide village, within walking distance of every conceivable amenity including the Dart station. A perfect location to really enjoy the unique village atmosphere with its wonderful array of boutiques, well known restaurants and of course the historic Malahide Castle grounds.\r\n\r\nInternally the property enjoys spacious well planned accommodation throughout with a large open plan living room/kitchen enjoying access to a south-facing balcony. There are two excellent bedrooms both en-suite as well as useful attic storage room. The kitchen and en-suites have been upgraded and the property has been well maintained throughout. \r\n\r\nThe communal grounds are approached by electronic security gates with designated car parking. \r\n\r\nTo really appreciate this excellent property, viewing is essential.\r\n\r\n\r\nSteps to Balcony (first floor) 4.36m x 2.63m. South-facing with red quarry tiled floor\r\n\r\nEntrance Porch 1.28m x 1.25m. Red quarry tiled floor, hardwood and glass panel door\r\n\r\nLiving Room/Kitchen 6.59m x 4.36m. Bright and spacious open plan kitchen/living room with superb Shaker style fitted kitchen, excellent press units, worktops, sink unit, built-in oven, hob, extractor unit, covings and spotlights on ceiling\r\n\r\nLobby Area Stairs to upper floor\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 (rear) 3.82m x 2.82m. Excellent built-in wardrobes\r\n\r\nEn-suite 2.00m x 1.96m. Shower, w/c, whb\r\n\r\nLanding (upper floor) Hot press\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom 3.90m x 3.68m. Excellent built-in wardrobes, attractive window detail\r\n\r\nEn-suite 2.85m x 2.62m. Modern suite with shower, w/c, whb with superb bathroom cabinet\r\n\r\nAttic Room 4.36m x 2.39m."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Property Features : \r\n\r\nSouth facing terrace to front \r\nSmall prestigious development\r\nElectronic security gates to front\r\nDesignated car parking\r\nExcellent fitted kitchen\r\n2 en-suite bedrooms\r\nAttic storage area\r\nVillage centre location\r\nManagement fee €700 per annum"
      },
